    "property_title": "Adelaida Meadow Residences: A Green Haven in Bancasi, Butuan City",
    "short_description": "",
    "description": "Adelaida Meadow Residences is A Brown’s nature-inspired housing community located in Barangay Bancasi, Butuan City. Designed to combine affordable living with modern comforts, this development brings peace and accessibility within reach—all just 6 km from city malls, churches, hospitals, and schools.\r\n\r\nHome Types & Design Aesthetics\r\n\r\nAdelaida Meadow focuses on house-and-lot units that offer lasting value and thoughtful design.\r\n\r\nSapphire Unit\r\nFloor 117 sqm\r\nLot 120-180 sqm\r\n3 bedroom\r\n3 toilet & bath\r\n1-carport with balcony\r\n\r\nFloorplans balance indoor-outdoor living, with sliding doors, open terraces, and landscaped yards.\r\n\r\nThis development provides family-friendly accommodations at more affordable pricing without compromising A Brown’s signature quality.\r\n\r\nLifestyle Features & Ambiance\r\nNature-themed community, with verdant landscaping, tree-lined streets, and open greenspace for walking and relaxation. ￼ ￼\r\nA gated, secure neighborhood that offers peace of mind and exclusivity.\r\n\r\nWant to explore unit availability, financing options, or floor plans? Send me a message and I’ll be happy to assist with details or arrange a site visit.",
